---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const listingPay = 'https://buy.stripe.com/9B66oH9qRcSjeDg75m6AM03';
const newsletterPay = 'https://buy.stripe.com/7sYfZh32t5pRfHkdtK6AM04';
const foundingPay = 'https://buy.stripe.com/cNi7sLeLb4lN7aO9du6AM02';
const inbox = 'me@maoxunxing.com';
const listingMail = `mailto:${inbox}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('CrossAgent Listing Boost')}`;
const newsletterMail = `mailto:${inbox}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('CrossAgent Newsletter Insert')}`;
const foundingMail = `mailto:${inbox}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('CrossAgent Lab Sponsorship Question')}`;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="赞助 — CrossAgent Lab"
  description="CrossAgent Lab 赞助：用例推广 $49/30天，简报插页 $99/期，Founding $349/月。流量未稳不报虚数；用例排序不出售。"
  canonicalPath="/sponsor/"
>
  <section class="hero-simple wrap">
    <h1>赞助 CrossAgent Lab</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      三条付费档位，面向主动来找「跨境 Agent 怎么用」的人：用例推广、简报插页、Founding 月赞助。
    </p>
    <p class="en">Three paid options — case boost, one newsletter insert, or a Founding monthly spot.</p>
    <p class="honest-strip panel">
      <strong>诚实页。</strong>流量尚未稳定，我们<strong>不</strong>公布虚荣 UV／打开率。用例自然排序与编辑位<strong>不出售</strong>——付费只买标注为赞助的位置。
      <span class="en">Honest page: traffic is not stable yet, so we do not publish vanity numbers. Organic case ranking and editorial placement are not for sale — paid slots are labeled as sponsored.</span>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap">
    <p id="boost-context" class="panel boost-context" hidden></p>

    <div class="tier-grid">
      <article class="panel tier-card" id="listing">
        <p class="tier-kicker">Boost · $49</p>
        <h3>用例推广 <span class="tier-en">Case / listing boost</span></h3>
        <p class="price-line">$49 <span class="price-unit">/ 30 天</span></p>
        <p class="price-sub">$49 / 30 days · labeled boost on one case</p>
        <ul>
          <li>30 天内把一条跨境 Agent 用例放到更靠前、更容易被打开的<strong>赞助位</strong>。</li>
          <li>可以是站内已有用例，或你提交并通过审的公开来源用例。</li>
          <li>展示品牌名与链接。用例正文仍是本站摘要，不改成软文，不编造数据。</li>
          <li>从用例卡片或详情点「推广此用例」，结账会带上那条用例。</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a
            id="listing-pay"
            class="btn"
            href={listingPay}
            data-base-href={listingPay}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored"
          >购买用例推广 <span class="btn-en">$49 / 30 days</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="muted-note">
          Stripe Checkout（CrossAgent Lab）。付款后请
          <a id="listing-mail" href={listingMail}>邮件告知</a>
          品牌名、链接和要推广的用例 URL。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel tier-card" id="newsletter">
        <p class="tier-kicker">Newsletter · $99</p>
        <h3>简报插页 <span class="tier-en">Newsletter insert</span></h3>
        <p class="price-line">$99 <span class="price-unit">/ 期</span></p>
        <p class="price-sub">$99 / issue · one labeled newsletter slot</p>
        <ul>
          <li>一期周报里的一个赞助插槽：品牌名、一句 pitch（约 40 字）、一个链接。</li>
          <li>读者是主动订阅「每周跨境 Agent 精选」的人，不是信息流流量。</li>
          <li>按购买的那一期插入。<strong>不</strong>预告、不编造打开率或订阅人数。</li>
          <li>适合要在一封信里被看到的工具、服务或课程，而不是长期首页位。</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a
            class="btn"
            href={newsletterPay}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored"
          >购买简报插页 <span class="btn-en">$99 / issue</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="muted-note">
          Stripe Checkout（CrossAgent Lab）。付款后请
          <a href={newsletterMail}>邮件告知</a>
          品牌名、pitch、链接，以及希望出现的期次。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel tier-card" id="founding">
        <p class="tier-kicker">Founding · $349</p>
        <h3>Founding 月赞助 <span class="tier-en">Monthly founding spot</span></h3>
        <p class="price-line">$349 <span class="price-unit">/ 月</span></p>
        <p class="price-sub">$349 / month · homepage bar + newsletter line</p>
        <ul>
          <li>首页底部赞助条：品牌名、一句 pitch（约 40 字内）、链接。</li>
          <li>周报内一行 Sponsored by（简报开通后，随月赞助持续）。</li>
          <li>同一时间只展示一位首页赞助方。已有在播或排队时，你的档期从上一档结束后开始。</li>
          <li>早期赞助启动价；名额有限，满员后涨价（新档位届时公布）。适合 ERP、广告、物流、选品合规与 Agent 产品。</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a
            class="btn"
            href={foundingPay}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored"
          >立即赞助 <span class="btn-en">$349 / month</span></a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href={foundingMail}>人民币 ¥2,500 / 先问一句</a>
        </div>
        <p class="muted-note">美元走 Stripe Checkout。人民币或定制档期发邮件，我们回复排期与付款方式。</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="sponsor-grid">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>钱买不到什么 <span class="tier-en">What money cannot buy</span></h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>用例自然排序不出售。</strong>编辑位、对比文、指南正文的先后顺序不因付款改变。</li>
          <li><strong>不卖「已验证」徽章，不卖自然排名。</strong>付费位一律标 Sponsored／推广。</li>
          <li><strong>流量未稳，不报虚数。</strong>有稳定、可复核数据后再更新媒体资料；现在问我们，只给真实后台数字（若有）。</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="en muted-note">Organic case order, comparisons, and guides are never sold. Paid slots are labeled. We do not invent UV or open rates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>谁会看到 <span class="tier-en">Who sees it</span></h3>
        <p>
          跨境卖家、中后台与广告同学，以及做 ERP / 物流 / 广告 / Agent 产品的团队。
          他们打开本站是为了找可复制的做法，不是刷信息流。
        </p>
        <p class="en">Cross-border operators and agent builders looking for a playbook they can copy.</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:1.25rem">付款之后 <span class="tier-en">After you pay</span></h3>
        <ul>
          <li>三档美元价格都在 Stripe Checkout 完成，页面上不收集卡号。</li>
          <li>成功后邮件 <a href={`mailto:${inbox}`}>{inbox}</a>：品牌名、链接；Listing 请附用例 URL，简报请附希望的期次。</li>
          <li>素材需真实。我们不改写用例事实，也不把摘要换成广告稿。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline define:vars={{ contactInbox: inbox }}>
  (function () {
    var params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
    var slug = params.get('case') || '';
    if (!/^[a-z0-9-]{1,80}$/.test(slug)) return;

    var note = document.getElementById('boost-context');
    if (note) {
      note.hidden = false;
      var link = document.createElement('a');
      link.href = '/cases/' + slug + '/';
      link.textContent = slug;
      note.append('正在推广此用例 / Boost this case: ');
      note.append(link);
      note.append('。下面的「用例推广」结账会带上这条用例标识。');
    }

    var pay = document.getElementById('listing-pay');
    if (pay) {
      var base = pay.getAttribute('data-base-href') || pay.href;
      var url = new URL(base);
      url.searchParams.set('client_reference_id', slug);
      pay.href = url.toString();
    }

    var mail = document.getElementById('listing-mail');
    if (mail) {
      var body = '用例 slug: ' + slug + '\n用例链接: ' + location.origin + '/cases/' + slug + '/\n\n品牌名:\n链接:\n';
      mail.href = 'mailto:' + contactInbox + '?subject=' + encodeURIComponent('CrossAgent Listing Boost: ' + slug) + '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(body);
    }
  })();
</script>
